Package: zzlongplot
Title: Longitudinal Plotting with Clinical Trials Support
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ronald G.", "Thomas", , "rgthomas@ucsd.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1686-4965"))
Description: Provides a formula interface for defining longitudinal plots
    with optional grouping, change-from-baseline panels, and faceting.
    Includes specialized support for clinical trials with CDISC variable
    detection, regulatory and journal themes, and publication-ready
    export.
